| CylindricalViT | 8 | 9.443 ± 0.014 | 1.231 ± 0.006 | 45.06 ± 0.25 |
| YawAug-xRIR | 8 | 9.322 ± 0.006 | 1.294 ± 0.006 | 46.39 ± 0.15 |
| SimpleViT (control) | 1 | 13.38 ± 0.10 | 1.890 ± 0.013 | 68.28 ± 0.61 |
